{
  "slug": "brilliant-directories",
  "name": "Brilliant Directories",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Official plugin for Brilliant Directories — the membership and directory website platform powering 50,000+ sites. Manage members, posts, leads, reviews, pages, email templates, forms, menus, tags, and redirects directly from Claude. Works on any BD-powered site by providing your site URL and API key.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 MCP server**, `brilliant-directories`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install brilliant-directories@claude-community` from `brilliantdirectories/brilliant-directories-mcp`.\n\nUniversal AI integration for your BD site. Give any AI agent full access to your Brilliant Directories site with one API key.",
